body":"[A10] Ruling on acceptance item 1 (A635, REVIEW READY at 16c89c53; composed with main 77cf6fb4 as 42eb9aef, PR #187).\n\nThe cut does what this issue exists for:\n- every path from `cmdq_count_r` to `sel_r` is gone;\n- the router's scan is off the acknowledge;\n- with the parent's #760, route-1x1 moves from WNS +0.016 ns, below the +0.03 ns floor, to +0.144 ns, and the worst path leaves this cone.\n\nThe \"depth roughly halves\" target is not met (22 levels OOC, 24 routed). The remaining depth sits inside `u_aecp`, `u_dispatch`, `u_scoreboard` and `u_listener`, which were outside this lane's scope.\n\nItem 1 is replaced by its purpose: **the cone no longer limits the shipping timing gate.** That will be re-measured on the next pin adoption's image. If that image misses the floor on a path through those four blocks, a new issue owns the internal depth; no issue is opened before that.\n\nSo this PR may close #181 once both reviews are POSITIVE and the banks pass.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/comments/6249065327/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/comments/6252495012","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/181#issuecomment-6252495012","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/181","id":6252495012,"node_id":"IC_kwDOT06kyc8AAAABdK2ApA","user":{"login":"Mister-M-alt","id":161579364,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaGBZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161579364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt","followers_url":"https://a